Release/

# Ignore extensionless binaries next to source files,
# then re-include source and project files.
*
!*/
!*.cpp
!*.c
!*.cc
!*.cxx
!*.h
!*.hpp
!*.hxx
!*.md
!*.txt
!*.json
!.gitignore
